      "message": "If you want to keep these under \"zephyr/boards/arm/npcx9\", a problem is how to include the correct NPCX_VARIANTS.dtsi (npcx9m3f.dtsi/npcx9m6f.dtsi/npcx9m7f.dtsi) in zephyr/boards/arm/npcx9/npcx9.dts conditionally? I am not sure if there is a approach to pass a defination to npcx9.dts file. If it is, we may include the variant like this:\n```\n#ifdef IS_SOC_NPCX9M3F\n#include \u003cnuvoton/npcx9m3f.dtsi\n...\n```\n@Keith\nDo you have comments on if we should support differecnt varianst in the single npcx9.dts or seperate npcx9mxf.dts files?",
