      "writtenOn": "2022-04-22T17:27:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The contents of the zephyr/boards directory is required by the Zephyr build system.\n\nhttps://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/hardware/porting/board_porting.html#create-your-board-directory\n\nLooking at other Zephyr boards upstream, there is only limited sharing between different boards using the \"common\" directory:\n\nhttps://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/tree/main/boards/common\n\nSo this is probably the best approach for now.  You could investigate trying to move any shared code from boards/npcx9 and boards/npcx9m7f to a shared directory.\n\nIt probably also makes sense to rename boards/npcx9 to boards/npcx9m3f for consistency.  But this can be done as follow up effort.",
      "parentUuid": "093db629_e244c1c1",
      "revId": "be052609c973ef76f4efb8f51165d848695efcac",
